"• DOOM Eternal Mod Injector (Mods, new files in 'base', EternalModInjector.bat, EternalModManager.exe)\n• DOOM Eternal Archipelago (Archipelago Mod)\n• Meathook framework (XINPUT1_3.dll)\n• doometernal.apworld",
