"[HEADER] Installation Infos",
"kill",
"When you click 'START SETUP' in the 'SETUP' tab, doometernal.apworld will be installed and moved into the 'custom_worlds' folder inside the Archipelago Launcher directory. The Mod Injector and XINPUT1_3.dll (Meathook) will be installed inside the game's core directory, then, the AP Mod client (DOOM Eternal Archipelago) is installed inside 'Documents' and the '.zip' mod pack will be moved to the 'Mods' folder inside the game's folder.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] apworld / yaml Infos",
"kill",
"DOOM Eternal is not a core Archipelago game, it needs a custom world file. When 'doometernal.apworld' is downloaded in the Archipelago Folder (by clicking START SETUP), boot-up the Archipelago Launcher and go to 'Options Creator' to create your .yaml file and then, when you're done, send it to the person who will host the AP Multiworld.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Connection Infos",
"kill",
"Once everything is setup, (re)start the Archipelago Launcher, look for 'DOOM Eternal Client' and open it. It will ask you to select:\n\n- The AP Client directory\n(should be: Documents\DOOM Eternal Archipelago\client)\n\n- DOOM Eternal's installation\n(should be: C:\Program Files (x86)\Steam\steamapps\common\DOOMEternal)\n\n- DOOM Saved Games\n(should be: C:\Users\YOUR NAME\Saved Games\id Software\DOOMEternal)\n\nAfter that, it will open a Text Client, connect to it like you'd normally do with any client.\n\nWhen you're connected, launch DOOM Eternal through Steam and if it opens the launcher, select 'Play DOOM Eternal' NOT WITH MODS!\n\nAfter launching the game, go to 'DOOM Eternal Archipelago\client' folder inside your Documents directory and double-click 'start_injector_windows.bat'.\n\nYou can go back to the game, start a new save and in the command console opened by start_injector_windows.bat, a message saying 'RPC Memory OPEN' (CLOSED if you pause) should show up.\n\nIf it shows up, it should be working :)\n\nIf the message doesn't show up, check the 'Troubleshoot' section.",
"kill",
"[HEADER] Revert Infos",
"kill",
"You have 2 revert options, both can't be enabled at the same time.\n\nIf you use the 'Clear AP Mods' option it will only delete the mods that are required for DOOM Eternal Archipelago. For this game it will only delete the mod zip folder and keep Meathook + Mod Injector.\n\nIf you use the 'Full Clear' option it will delete everything related to Mod Injector, Meathook and mods. If other mods are detected an additionnal confirmation will appear.",
